{"version":1,"content":"<p>以色列軍方向亞馬遜雲平台上傳350萬張照片，藉助這家美國企業的人臉識別技術，分析巴勒斯坦人的影像資料。泄露文件顯示，這批海量影像庫，是在以色列對加沙發起猛烈空襲與地面攻勢初期，被上傳至亞馬遜雲端的。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586778.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T08:30:51.700103+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":104,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T08:18:52+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T08:24:10.776494+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T08:24:10.776494+00:00","content_hash":"cf6e387e56d7fbcdc109ba7cda90cddf6f0dd62e3d0c2e383abef41566368909","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}